<title>HONG KONG: Chen Hsong year profit up 18.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Chen Hsong year profit up 18.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   37.9     vs 32.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0     vs 13.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 17.01 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    231.09   vs 195.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,101.50 vs 1,100.96</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chen Hsong Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 9-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Chen Hsong is a plastic machinery manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 20 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of five cents) vs 18 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
